text: ['({T}: Add {B}.)', '({T}: Add {G}.)', '({T}: Add {R}.)', '({T}: Add {U}.)', '({T}: Add {W}.)', 'Add {B}{B}{B}.', 'Arc Lightning deals 3 damage divided as you choose among one, two, or three targets.', 'At the beginning of the end step, if no creatures are on the battlefield, sacrifice Pestilence.\n{B}: Pestilence deals 1 damage to each creature and each player.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, each opponent loses 1 life. You gain life equal to the life lost this way.', 'At the beginning of your upkeep, if an opponent controls more lands than you, you may search your library for up to three basic land cards, reveal them, put them into your hand, then shuffle.', 'Choose one —\n• Target player gains 3 life.\n• Prevent the next 3 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', 'Counter target spell unless its controller pays {3}.', 'Counter target spell.', "Defender (This creature can't attack.)", "Destroy all creatures. They can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy all enchantments.', "Destroy all lands or all creatures. Creatures destroyed this way can't be regenerated.", 'Destroy target artifact or enchantment.', "Destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. It can't be regenerated.", 'Drifting Meadow enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {W}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Each opponent discards two cards.', 'Each player discards their hand, then draws cards equal to the greatest number of cards a player discarded this way.', 'Each player exiles all creature cards from their graveyard, then sacrifices all creatures they control, then puts all cards they exiled this way onto the battlefield.', 'Each player puts a creature card from their graveyard onto the battlefield.', "Each player returns a creature they control to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature can't attack or block.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +1/+3.\n{W}: Return enchanted creature to its owner's hand.", "Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets +2/+2 and can't block.", 'Enchant creature\nEnchanted creature gets -2/-1.', 'Enchant creature\nWhenever a creature dies, put a +1/+1 counter on enchanted creature.', 'Enchant creature\nYou control enchanted creature.', 'Enchant land\nWhenever enchanted land is tapped for mana, its controller adds an additional one mana of any color.', 'Exile target creature. Its controller gains life equal to its power.', "First strike\nWhen Nekrataal enters the battlefield, destroy target nonartifact, nonblack creature. That creature can't be regenerated.", 'First strike\n{W}: Target creature gains first strike until end of turn.', 'Flying', 'Flying\nWhenever Abyssal Specter deals damage to a player, that player discards a card.', 'Flying\n{T}: Target attacking or blocking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', "Flying (This creature can't be blocked except by creatures with flying or reach.)\nWhenever a creature dealt damage by Sengir Vampire this turn dies, put a +1/+1 counter on Sengir Vampire.", 'Flying, haste', 'Haste (This creature can attack and {T} as soon as it comes under your control.)', 'Heat Ray deals X damage to target creature.', 'Hurricane deals X damage to each creature with flying and each player.', "Islandwalk (This creature can't be blocked as long as defending player controls an Island.)\n{G}: Regenerate River Boa.", "Lhurgoyf's power is equal to the number of creature cards in all graveyards and its toughness is equal to that number plus 1.", 'Polluted Mire enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {B}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Protection from white\n{1}{R}: Wildfire Emissary gets +1/+0 until end of turn.', 'Put target creature card from a graveyard onto the battlefield under your control. You lose life equal to its mana value.', 'Remote Isle enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {U}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', "Return Broken Fall to its owner's hand: Regenerate target creature.", 'Rolling Thunder deals X damage divided as you choose among any number of targets.', 'Sacrifice Sanctum Guardian: The next time a source of your choice would deal damage to any target this turn, prevent that damage.', 'Sacrifice a creature: Phyrexian Ghoul gets +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Sandstorm deals 1 damage to each attacking creature.', 'Shadow (This creature can block or be blocked by only creatures with shadow.)', 'Shower of Sparks deals 1 damage to target creature and 1 damage to target player or planeswalker.', "Shroud (This creature can't be the target of spells or abilities.)", 'Skyshroud Elite gets +1/+2 as long as an opponent controls a nonbasic land.', 'Slippery Karst enters the battlefield tapped.\n{T}: Add {G}.\nCycling {2} ({2}, Discard this card: Draw a card.)', 'Spike Colony enters the battlefield with four +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Colony: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Spike Feeder enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\nRemove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Feeder: You gain 2 life.', 'Spike Weaver enters the battlefield with three +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Weaver: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.\n{1}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Weaver: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn.', 'Spike Worker enters the battlefield with two +1/+1 counters on it.\n{2}, Remove a +1/+1 counter from Spike Worker: Put a +1/+1 counter on target creature.', 'Steam Blast deals 2 damage to each creature and each player.', 'Syphon Soul deals 2 damage to each other player. You gain life equal to the damage dealt this way.', 'Target creature gets +3/+3 until end of turn.', 'Target player draws four cards.', 'Two target creatures each get +2/+2 until end of turn.', 'Untap target creature an opponent controls and gain control of it until end of turn. That creature gains haste until end of turn. When you lose control of the creature, tap it.', 'When Cackling Fiend enters the battlefield, each opponent discards a card.', "When Man-o'-War enters the battlefield, return target creature to its owner's hand.", 'Whenever Seasoned Marshal attacks, you may tap target creature.', "Whenever a creature dies, that creature's controller may draw a card.", 'Whenever an opponent plays a land, put a +1/+1 counter on Dirtcowl Wurm.', 'Whenever another creature enters the battlefield, you gain 1 life.', "{0}: Return Blinking Spirit to its owner's hand.", '{1}{G}: Target creature blocks Trumpeting Armodon this turn if able.', '{1}{W}: Prevent all combat damage that would be dealt this turn by target attacking creature with flying.', '{2}{G}: Plated Rootwalla gets +3/+3 until end of turn. Activate only once each turn.', '{B}, Pay 1 life: Sewer Rats gets +1/+0 until end of turn. Activate no more than three times each turn.', '{G}, {T}, Sacrifice Elvish Lyrist: Destroy target enchantment.', '{G}, {T}, Sacrifice a Forest: Regenerate target creature.', '{R}: Regenerate Uthden Troll.', "{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {B} or {R}. Cinder Marsh doesn't untap during your next untap step.", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {G} or {W}. Vec Townships doesn't untap during your next untap step.", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {R} or {G}. Mogg Hollows doesn't untap during your next untap step.", "{T}: Add {C}.\n{T}: Add {W} or {U}. Thalakos Lowlands doesn't untap during your next untap step.", '{T}: Add {G}.', '{T}: Counter target spell unless its controller pays {1}.', '{T}: Fire Ants deals 1 damage to each other creature without flying.', '{T}: Prevent the next 2 damage that would be dealt to any target this turn.', '{T}: Prodigal Sorcerer deals 1 damage to any target.', '{T}: Target attacking creature gets +1/+1 until end of turn.', '{T}: Untap target creature.', '{T}: Untap two target lands.', '{U}: Manta Riders gains flying until end of turn.', '{U}{U}: Tap target creature without flying.', '{W}, {T}: Tap target creature.']
